---------- Recipe via Meal-Master (tm) v8.05
 
      Title: Chocolate Chip Cookies
 Categories: Dessert, Cookies
      Yield: 24 cookies
 
      2 c  Flour
    1/2 ts Salt
      1 c  Butter, softened
      2 ea Eggs
           -chilled
 
  Cream butter and sugar.  Add eggs and beat
  well.
 
  Bake at 375F for 10 minutes.
 
-----
